sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Cliente
    participant F as Front-end App Service (HTTPS)
    participant A as FastAPI (:8000)
    participant D as SQLite
    C->>F: POST /tarefas {"titulo": "..."}
    F->>A: repassa a requisição
    A->>A: valida o JSON (Pydantic)
    A->>D: INSERT INTO tarefas
    D-->>A: id da nova tarefa
    A-->>F: 201 Created + tarefa em JSON
    F-->>C: resposta
